 "summary": "A single 100 V N-channel enhancement power MOSFET from Infineon's OptiMOS 5 line, in the leadless 5 mm × 6 mm PG-TDSON-8 (SuperSO8) package with three source leads, one gate lead and four drain leads joined to a large underside pad. On-resistance is 7.0 mΩ max at 10 V gate drive and 10.2 mΩ max at 6 V; it carries 80 A with the case at 25 °C. Total gate charge is 30 nC and output charge 41 nC typical, aimed at switch-mode supplies and synchronous rectifiers. Every unit is avalanche tested.",
